model law_hole
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the round's mutation run (book/adjust.rs NamedReads::touched_by; book/members.rs unread_hole, span_members): pw's day and its at are window rows, so nothing of it is read; a later version makes an adjustment of it only where it states a row of what pw names, and u (an input pw doesn't read) and ui (a key of an index pw doesn't read) state none; a field of pw is the hole, read by its name or met by a binding (L §5.14 at e, E §5 step 2; N2)"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind people: parties

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input unrelated: money PLN
input w: date
input wa: date

move pw: transfers
  on w
  at wa
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  unrelated = 1.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-25) "s"
  wa = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-03) "s"
  people + [ann] lives 2020-01-01..
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[other] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version u
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-03-20
  replace unrelated = 5.00 PLN "s"

version ui
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-03-21
  people + [bob] lives 2020-01-01..

ask adj: count(a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04)
ask to_other: count(x in transfers over 2026-03 where x.cash.to == other)
ask direct_amt: pw.cash.amount
ask direct_to: pw.cash.to
ask keys: count(p in people on 2026-04-01)
